1
00:00:00,948 --> 00:00:04,828
(Howard:)All right. Well, could you at least
give her a message?

2
00:00:04,993 --> 00:00:06,623
(Penny:)Yeah, sure, I guess.

3
00:00:07,579 --> 00:00:10,539
(Howard:)Tell her I'm really sorry.

4
00:00:10,707 --> 00:00:15,797
(Howard:)And if she doesn't want to marry me,
l get it.

5
00:00:16,004 --> 00:00:20,464
(Howard:)But what I really want her to know is
that the guy that she's disgusted by...

6
00:00:20,634 --> 00:00:24,804
(Howard:)...is the guy that I'm disgusted by too,
but that guy doesn't exist anymore.

7
00:00:25,013 --> 00:00:26,513
(Howard:)He's gone.

8
00:00:26,682 --> 00:00:31,392
(Howard:)And the reason is because of her.

9
00:00:31,562 --> 00:00:33,192
(Leonard:)So...

10
00:00:33,355 --> 00:00:36,815
(Howard:)...if this relationship is over...

11
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:41,154
(Howard:)...let her know that
she made me a better man...

12
00:00:41,321 --> 00:00:44,871
(Howard:)...and tell her thank you.

13
00:00:46,034 --> 00:00:48,664
(Penny:)Oh, my God, Howard.

14
00:00:50,038 --> 00:00:53,378
(Penny:)That's the most beautiful thing
l've ever heard.

15
00:00:53,542 --> 00:00:59,022
(Penny:)And it came out of you.

